WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.040
Hola abuela.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.560
Any changes, Spencer?

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.080
What changes Gina?

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:14.760
Honestly,

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.680
you've already lost her.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.960
And, it's not just my opinion

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:22.960
The chief was here today,

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:24.480
and he recommended

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:26.800
unplugging her.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:29.840
No.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:30.920
No.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.760
Please don't do this.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:33.960
Think of something.

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:34.920
I beg you.

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:36.240
For the sake of the years

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:37.920
that we had together.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:40.840
Spencer,

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:43.840
what can save her?

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:48.120
Maybe Christmas miracle.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.760
This year, the Hendersons

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:58.200
are playing Santa!

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:00.800
Let's keep believing in miracles.

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:14.400
Hey.

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:15.920
I'm ready to meet.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.840
I have a proposal for you, Walt.
